{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_045_23_5_02_045_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9692fb0ebf606fabebdb564bde37cd6d8f009369b1697a8f83cdf40a87de2240",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_23_5_02_045_23:5_02_045_23:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:931dcae93fac16bdb9d84535a534535d5b0d3dcd81a016557c78fd2bb4d5330c",
      "text": "啊，找到啦。\n●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_23_5_02_045_23:5_02_045_23:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52696d52e2df680aea2bd335b43383ed1e5410897b66a22f3643f48e19db50a6",
      "text": "给，这个。今天不是白色情人节嘛～？\n我把我的回礼带来了哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_23_5_02_045_23:5_02_045_23:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad4840ed9cc25a90ea3e88d25e1deecdfe4f4ada67994237fb02f9e2d4dd981b",
      "text": "辛苦了，想乐先生。\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_23_5_02_045_23:5_02_045_23:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:067f1d7feaba33d820af994b45e61c60e98fe5230ad2d64366c037023ff342cc",
      "text": "不客气～这次是我推荐的茶与落雁点心的礼盒哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_23_5_02_045_23:5_02_045_23:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d34027739a60ffcbbc83f14a3124c8c89f4188a2e5b2cfd931224ec24593b539",
      "text": "今年想送给制作人的东西，\n很快就决定下来了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_23_5_02_045_23:5_02_045_23:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2475ecc3297c8eaf7ad78c5e1435aa9c07ef2190c75090da6e3fda839729d542",
      "text": "大概是因为一直在一起工作的缘故吧～。不知不觉间，\n喜好之类的变得更容易想象出来了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_23_5_02_045_23:5_02_045_23:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ddb1a77df6ce4aaa0430a70b7fb709d10030bd603d67972049ce8c6fe78fd20",
      "text": "暂歇双翼，在日常的缝隙中觅得安宁。\n……若是想喘口气歇一歇了，就拆开来看看吧～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_23_5_02_045_23:5_02_045_23:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a38d1d9564178afd2bd74be34251ba83c0c669b26fa2d0d28ddd59d820480055",
      "text": "我也多亏了从制作人那里收到的巧克力，\n得以好好放松了一下呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_23_5_02_045_23:5_02_045_23:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d134d327b338e01519b0bb178842d3ab730d390d10498d3901a6e63d2c9b673",
      "text": "要是能送给你同样的惬意时光我就很开心了哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_23_5_02_045_23:5_02_045_23:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d8d236100e75d887f1459a8759e79e0730d445ee4ae15d72ffd72d3061bb814",
      "text": "您的这份体贴关照让我很高兴。\n我会好好珍惜享用的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
